fs.read(fd, buffer, offset, length, position, callback)

Added in: v0.0.2

History

VersionChanges

v18.0.0Passing an invalid callback to the callback argument now throws ERR_INVALID_ARG_TYPE instead of ERR_INVALID_CALLBACK.

