fs.watch(filename[, options][, listener])

Added in: v0.5.10

History

VersionChanges

v26.1.0Added throwIfNoEntry option.

v19.1.0Added recursive support for Linux, AIX and IBMi.

v15.9.0, v14.17.0Added support for closing the watcher with an AbortSignal.

