http2.connect(authority[, options][, listener])

Added in: v8.4.0

History

VersionChanges

v26.11.0Added the connectionWindowSize option.

v15.10.0, v14.16.0, v12.21.0, v10.24.0Added unknownProtocolTimeout option with a default of 10000.

v14.4.0, v12.18.0, v10.21.0Added maxSettings option with a default of 32.

v13.0.0The PADDING_STRATEGY_CALLBACK has been made equivalent to providing PADDING_STRATEGY_ALIGNED and selectPadding has been removed.

