Results in process.execArgv:

    ["--icu-data-dir=./foo", "--require", "./bar.js"]

    json

And process.argv:

    ["/usr/local/bin/node", "script.js", "--version"]

    json

Refer to Worker constructor for the detailed behavior of worker threads with this property.

