port.postMessage(value[, transferList])

Added in: v10.5.0

History

VersionChanges

v21.0.0An error is thrown when an untransferable object is in the transfer list.

v15.14.0, v14.18.0Add 'BlockList' to the list of cloneable types.

v15.9.0, v14.18.0Add 'Histogram' types to the list of cloneable types.

v15.6.0Added X509Certificate to the list of cloneable types.

